WEBVTT

00:05:29.226 --> 00:05:32.298
had to do so with essentially the same equipment

00:05:32.298 --> 00:05:34.963
that Eddy Merckx used in 1972.

00:05:34.963 --> 00:05:37.218
Where does the record stand today?

00:05:37.218 --> 00:05:40.840
30 miles, 4,657 feet,

00:05:40.840 --> 00:05:43.950
a grand total of 883 feet

00:05:43.950 --> 00:05:45.726
farther than Eddy Merckx cycled

00:05:45.726 --> 00:05:47.427
more than four decades ago.

00:05:47.427 --> 00:05:49.808
Essentially the entire improvement in this record

00:05:49.808 --> 00:05:51.860
was due to technology.

00:05:51.860 --> 00:05:55.030
Still, technology isn't the only
thing pushing athletes forward.

00:05:55.030 --> 00:05:56.481
While indeed we haven't evolved

00:05:56.481 --> 00:05:58.198
into a new species in a century,

00:05:58.198 --> 00:06:00.158
the gene pool within competitive sports